                For most people, the Anker SOLIX C300X: 288 watt-hours of LiFePO4 with a 300-watt pure sine inverter and strong USB-C output, which covers laptops, CPAPs without humidifiers, fans, routers and small TVs. If you need more than 300 watts of AC, the Bluetti EB3A or EcoFlow River 3 Plus doubles the inverter to 600 watts.
              </p>
